      "title": "herbsandharvest.guide_book.cheese.supp",
      "summary": "For Cheese Making, you need the following:\n-Milk Buckets (An assortment, for different cheeses)\n-A Cauldron with a heat source below it\n-Rennet\n-Salt\n-A Cheese Aging Shelf",
